  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Loom?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3b/Loom.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925184334\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Loom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Loom\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Loom</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 17</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 3,200</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  1 d</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2×2</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 47</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Loom</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 17.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/sweater-2162\" title=\"Sweater\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">sweaters</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/cotton-fabric-14252\" title=\"Cotton Fabric\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cotton fabric</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/blue-woolly-hat-2250\" title=\"Blue Woolly Hat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">blue woolly hats</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/blue-sweater-2161\" title=\"Blue Sweater\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">blue sweaters</a>&#160;,&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/red-scarf-8888\" title=\"Red Scarf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">red scarves</a>&#160;and&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/flower-shawl-28431\" title=\"Flower Shawl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">flower shawl</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The Loom looks like a wooden floor loom with a chair in front of it. Red fabric is being woven.\n</p><p>The mastered version gains a golden star at its top and a wooden platform.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>It costs 3,200 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 1 day (or 47 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>) to build the Loom. It gives players 24 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when completed.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Products</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/sweater-2162\" title=\"Sweater\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Sweater\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/cotton-fabric-14252\" title=\"Cotton fabric\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Cotton fabric\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/blue-woolly-hat-2250\" title=\"Blue woolly hat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue woolly hat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/sweater-2162\" title=\"Sweater\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sweater</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/cotton-fabric-14252\" title=\"Cotton Fabric\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cotton Fabric</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/blue-woolly-hat-2250\" title=\"Blue Woolly Hat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Woolly Hat</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 17\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 18\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 19\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 h\n</td>\n<td>30 min\n</td>\n<td>1 h\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 1 h 42 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 25 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 51 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>4<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>151<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>108<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>111<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>18<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>13<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>13<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/blue-sweater-2161\" title=\"Blue sweater\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blue sweater\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/red-scarf-8888\" title=\"Red scarf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Red scarf\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/flower-shawl-28431\" title=\"Flower shawl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Flower shawl\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/blue-sweater-2161\" title=\"Blue Sweater\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blue Sweater</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/red-scarf-8888\" title=\"Red Scarf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Red Scarf</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/flower-shawl-28431\" title=\"Flower Shawl\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Flower Shawl</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 20\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 48\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 71\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 h\n</td>\n<td>2 h 30 min\n</td>\n<td>1 h 30 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 2 h 33 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 2 h 7 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 1 h 16 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>6<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>5<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>208<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>288<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>295<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>34<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>35<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The Loom originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> than the previous one. Alternatively, they can spend a total of 105 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> to completely upgrade their machine.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Mastering</b></span></h3>\n<p>A total of 1,116 hours of production is required to <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">master</a> the Loom:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/6a/Loom_Mastered.png/revision/latest?cb=20250925184422\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mastered Loom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastered Loom\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b>★<br>36 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★<br>180 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★★<br>900 hrs</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Mastery_I.png/revision/latest?cb=20260602234714\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery I\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"61\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/1/14/Mastery_II_10.png/revision/latest?cb=20260605001726\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery II 10\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"63\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/31/Loom_Mastery.png/revision/latest?cb=20180501173905\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Loom Mastery\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"60\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+10% <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b>15% faster</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>All products except cotton fabric require one or more units of <a href=\"/wiki/wool-2270\" title=\"Wool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wool</a>. Wool is easily found in the <a href=\"/wiki/daily-dirt-2679\" title=\"Daily Dirt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Dirt</a>.</li>\n<li>The Loom is easy to master if you make lots of sweaters.</li>\n<li>You can speed up the production of the Loom using a green <a href=\"/wiki/booster-28721\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Booster\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">booster</a>.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bath-kiosk-34840\" title=\"Bath Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bath Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bbq-grill-3552\" title=\"BBQ Grill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BBQ Grill</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cake-oven-3556\" title=\"Cake Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cake Oven</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candle-maker-16469\" title=\"Candle Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candle Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Machine</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/coffee-kiosk-3564\" title=\"Coffee Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coffee Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cupcake-maker-35636\" title=\"Cupcake Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cupcake Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/dairy-3547\" title=\"Dairy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dairy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/deep-fryer-33952\" title=\"Deep Fryer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Deep Fryer</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/doner-kebab-stand-36894\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doner Kebab Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Doner Kebab Stand</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/donut-maker-34959\" title=\"Donut Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Donut Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/duck-salon-17003\" title=\"Duck Salon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duck Salon</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/essential-oils-lab-36027\" title=\"Essential Oils Lab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Essential Oils Lab</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/feed-mill-3546\" title=\"Feed Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Feed 